# SupplyEagle conventions

- Apps: `@supplyeagle/web`, `@supplyeagle/api`, `@supplyeagle/agents`. Shared contracts: `@supplyeagle/types`.
- Use pnpm workspaces + Turborepo. Do not enable Nest CLI monorepo mode.
- Depend on workspace packages with `workspace:*`.
- Keep imports at the top of the file. No inline imports.
- Shared request/response types go in `packages/types` before they are used in more than one app.
- Product HTTP belongs in `apps/api`. Agent workers belong in `apps/agents`.
